{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22863","headline":"百花亭晚望夜归 · 白居易","name":"百花亭晚望夜归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百花亭上晚裴回，云影阴晴掩复开。\n日色悠扬暎山尽，雨声萧飒渡江来。\n鬓毛遇病双如雪，心绪逢秋一似灰。\n向夜欲归愁未了，满湖明月小船回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}